ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja456:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja456:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja456:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja456:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja456:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja456:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja456:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja456:0.2": "Ekādasakanipāta ", "ja456:0.3": "Mātuposakavagga ", "ja456:0.4": "2. Juṇhajātaka ", "ja456:1.1": "“Suṇohi mayhaṁ vacanaṁ janinda, ", "ja456:1.2": "Atthena juṇhamhi idhānupatto; ", "ja456:1.3": "Na brāhmaṇe addhike tiṭṭhamāne, ", "ja456:1.4": "Gantabbamāhu dvipadindaseṭṭha”. ", "ja456:2.1": "“Suṇomi tiṭṭhāmi vadehi brahme, ", "ja456:2.2": "Yenāsi atthena idhānupatto; ", "ja456:2.3": "Kaṁ vā tvamatthaṁ mayi patthayāno, ", "ja456:2.4": "Idhāgamā brahme tadiṅgha brūhi”. ", "ja456:3.1": "“Dadāhi me gāmavarāni pañca, ", "ja456:3.2": "Dāsīsataṁ satta gavaṁsatāni; ", "ja456:3.3": "Parosahassañca suvaṇṇanikkhe, ", "ja456:3.4": "Bhariyā ca me sādisī dve dadāhi. ", "ja456:4.1": "Tapo nu te brāhmaṇa bhiṁsarūpo, ", "ja456:4.2": "Mantā nu te brāhmaṇa cittarūpā; ", "ja456:4.3": "Yakkhā nu te assavā santi keci, ", "ja456:4.4": "Atthaṁ vā me abhijānāsi kattaṁ. ", "ja456:5.1": "Na me tapo atthi na cāpi mantā, ", "ja456:5.2": "Yakkhāpi me assavā natthi keci; ", "ja456:5.3": "Atthampi te nābhijānāmi kattaṁ, ", "ja456:5.4": "Pubbe ca kho saṅgatimattamāsi. ", "ja456:6.1": "Paṭhamaṁ idaṁ dassanaṁ jānato me, ", "ja456:6.2": "Na tābhijānāmi ito puratthā; ", "ja456:6.3": "Akkhāhi me pucchito etamatthaṁ, ", "ja456:6.4": "Kadā kuhiṁ vā ahu saṅgamo no. ", "ja456:7.1": "Gandhārarājassa puramhi ramme, ", "ja456:7.2": "Avasimhase takkasīlāyaṁ deva; ", "ja456:7.3": "Tatthandhakāramhi timīsikāyaṁ, ", "ja456:7.4": "Aṁsena aṁsaṁ samaghaṭṭayimha. ", "ja456:8.1": "Te tattha ṭhatvāna ubho janinda, ", "ja456:8.2": "Sārāṇiyaṁ vītisārayimha tattha; ", "ja456:8.3": "Sāyeva no saṅgatimattamāsi, ", "ja456:8.4": "Tato na pacchā na pure ahosi. ", "ja456:9.1": "Yadā kadāci manujesu brahme, ", "ja456:9.2": "Samāgamo sappurisena hoti; ", "ja456:9.3": "Na paṇḍitā saṅgatisanthavāni, ", "ja456:9.4": "Pubbe kataṁ vāpi vināsayanti. ", "ja456:10.1": "Bālāva kho saṅgatisanthavāni, ", "ja456:10.2": "Pubbe kataṁ vāpi vināsayanti; ", "ja456:10.3": "Bahumpi bālesu kataṁ vinassati, ", "ja456:10.4": "Tathā hi bālā akataññurūpā. ", "ja456:11.1": "Dhīrā ca kho saṅgatisanthavāni, ", "ja456:11.2": "Pubbe kataṁ vāpi na nāsayanti; ", "ja456:11.3": "Appampi dhīresu kataṁ na nassati, ", "ja456:11.4": "Tathā hi dhīrā sukataññurūpā. ", "ja456:12.1": "Dadāmi te gāmavarāni pañca, ", "ja456:12.2": "Dāsīsataṁ satta gavaṁsatāni; ", "ja456:12.3": "Parosahassañca suvaṇṇanikkhe, ", "ja456:12.4": "Bhariyā ca te sādisī dve dadāmi. ", "ja456:13.1": "Evaṁ sataṁ hoti samecca rāja, ", "ja456:13.2": "Nakkhattarājāriva tārakānaṁ; ", "ja456:13.3": "Āpūratī kāsipatī tathāhaṁ, ", "ja456:13.4": "Tayāpi me saṅgamo ajja laddho”ti. ", "ja456:14.1": "Juṇhajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja456:0.1": "", "ja456:0.2": "", "ja456:0.3": "", "ja456:0.4": "", "ja456:1.1": "", "ja456:1.2": "", "ja456:1.3": "", "ja456:1.4": "Gantabbamāhu → gantabyamāhu (mr) | dvipadindaseṭṭha → dipadānaseṭṭha (bj, pts-vp-pli1); dvipadānaseṭṭha (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja456:2.1": "", "ja456:2.2": "Yenāsi → yenāpi (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja456:2.3": "", "ja456:2.4": "", "ja456:3.1": "", "ja456:3.2": "", "ja456:3.3": "", "ja456:3.4": "", "ja456:4.1": "", "ja456:4.2": "", "ja456:4.3": "Yakkhā nu → yakkhāva (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja456:4.4": "", "ja456:5.1": "", "ja456:5.2": "", "ja456:5.3": "", "ja456:5.4": "ca kho → pubbeva kho (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja456:6.1": "", "ja456:6.2": "", "ja456:6.3": "", "ja456:6.4": "", "ja456:7.1": "", "ja456:7.2": "", "ja456:7.3": "timīsikāyaṁ → timissikāyaṁ (bj); timissakāyaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja456:7.4": "", "ja456:8.1": "", "ja456:8.2": "Sārāṇiyaṁ → sāraṇīyaṁ (mr) | vītisārayimha → vītisārimha (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja456:8.3": "", "ja456:8.4": "", "ja456:9.1": "", "ja456:9.2": "", "ja456:9.3": "", "ja456:9.4": "", "ja456:10.1": "Bālāva → bālā ca (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja456:10.2": "", "ja456:10.3": "", "ja456:10.4": "", "ja456:11.1": "", "ja456:11.2": "", "ja456:11.3": "", "ja456:11.4": "", "ja456:12.1": "", "ja456:12.2": "", "ja456:12.3": "", "ja456:12.4": "", "ja456:13.1": "", "ja456:13.2": "", "ja456:13.3": "", "ja456:13.4": "", "ja456:14.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja456:0.1": "", "ja456:0.2": "", "ja456:0.3": "", "ja456:0.4": "", "ja456:1.1": "bj30.390, ms22J_2120, msdiv13, pts-vp-pli4.97", "ja456:1.2": "", "ja456:1.3": "", "ja456:1.4": "", "ja456:2.1": "dr27.303, ms22J_2121, msdiv14, sya27.305", "ja456:2.2": "", "ja456:2.3": "", "ja456:2.4": "", "ja456:3.1": "ms22J_2122, msdiv15", "ja456:3.2": "", "ja456:3.3": "", "ja456:3.4": "", "ja456:4.1": "ms22J_2123, msdiv16, ndp22.220, pts-vp-pli4.98", "ja456:4.2": "", "ja456:4.3": "", "ja456:4.4": "", "ja456:5.1": "csp1ed22.228, csp2ed22.228, ms22J_2124, msdiv17", "ja456:5.2": "", "ja456:5.3": "", "ja456:5.4": "", "ja456:6.1": "ms22J_2125, msdiv18", "ja456:6.2": "", "ja456:6.3": "", "ja456:6.4": "", "ja456:7.1": "dr27.304, ms22J_2126, msdiv19, sya27.306", "ja456:7.2": "", "ja456:7.3": "", "ja456: